      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help putting together a 5-day itinerary for an exec traveling through southeast asia next month. they're hitting singapore, bangkok, and ho chi minh city for meetings. can u help me map out a schedule that keeps travel time low and includes stays at business-class hotels? needs to be pretty tight.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
